kness with cells or correct the extracted quantity by the printed delta. For an OWN-cell term the eps_r printed for that cell IS addressable: it is whatever the geometry puts on the live edge (issue #702), so a stack whose dielectric abuts the sheet's faces leaves vacuum there — extend the abutting dielectric across the sheet's cell, or register the sheet's mid-plane instead of its faces, and that term goes. COVERAGE: examined 1 adjacent sheet pair(s) from 2 node-thin conductor sheet(s) on the uniform lane; physical stack computed from Box entries only — 0 non-Box dielectric entr(y/ies) ignored (said so, per #703); 0 pair(s) skipped (conductor between). STALE IF: re-summing the printed column disagrees with these numbers, or sheets stop being registered node-thin.
